codex
The C++ patch now forces peer key-index metadata out on synchronous writes and route/adaptive paths, which targets the `not found` peer readbacks without changing the RDMA payload path. Next I’m adding a small CLI runner wrapper so only `rdma/FN-1` gets the needed TCP restart and restore during `functions/run_all.sh`.
