**Updating performance summaries**

I see that with our strict changes, the existing `performances/summary.md` might be stale since only 5 out of 9 passed. We should definitely run `python3 performances/run_all.py --refresh-summary` after we patch to update both summary and raw data. This command will ensure consistency, but it could modify the generated_at timestamp and rows to 4 passed. I think we should include a validation command, but it’s important not to fabricate anything. I'll make sure we check the build first!
